        10("<div style='font-weight: bold'>CQRS Unit of Work</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Custom .NET command and query handlers]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns IDE application logic.<br />Dispatches typed commands and<br />read-only queries to<br />registered handlers with<br />scoped context, validates<br />eligibility, and returns or<br />publishes their outcomes.</div>")
        style 10 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        12("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Editor Tab ViewModels (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.ComponentModel and SimpleMVC]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>One observable IView per<br />editor tab. The ViewModel<br />defines the public MCP<br />context for its workspace,<br />document, view key, and<br />revision.</div>")
        style 12 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
        13("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Language Services</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET, framed LSP JSON-RPC over stdio]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Manages configured server<br />processes, workspace roots<br />and language bindings.<br />Synchronizes versioned<br />documents, queues committed<br />saves before subsequent<br />close, and correlates<br />negotiated completion,<br />navigation, diagnostics, and<br />edit requests.</div>")
        style 13 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        22("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Source Editor</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: AvaloniaEdit.TextEditor]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Keeps independent tab<br />buffers, selection, caret,<br />undo and redo through<br />floating and redocking.<br />Provides find and replace,<br />syntax and plain fallback,<br />and diagnostic fixture<br />navigation. Live build<br />diagnostics and debugger<br />markers are later<br />integrations.</div>")
        style 22 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
        23("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Avalonia UI Dispatcher</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia Dispatcher.UIThread]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Schedules callbacks on the UI<br />thread. The dispatch owner<br />checks its originating<br />registration inside the<br />callback before applying the<br />result.</div>")
        style 23 fill:#235c49,stroke:#184033,color:#ffffff
        8("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Main MVC Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: GPS.SimpleMVC 2.0.0]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns dispatch and result<br />delivery for views registered<br />directly with it. Provides<br />the shared execution entry<br />point for typed requests from<br />all controllers into the<br />custom Unit of Work.</div>")
        style 8 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        9("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Document Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: GPS.SimpleMVC 2.0.0]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns dispatch for editor<br />views that register directly<br />with it. Receives their<br />events, dispatches typed<br />document requests through the<br />shared CQRS entry point, and<br />delivers results to the<br />originating tab.</div>")
        style 9 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
